  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#paragraphs:phrasing-content-2-2\r\n\r\n>  in an element that accepts content other than phrasing content as well as phrasing content, let first be the first node of the run, and let last be the last node of the run.\r\n\r\nWhat does this mean by `content other than phrasing content as well as phrasing content`?\r\n\r\nIn my understanding, maybe the \"run of sibling phrasing content nodes\" should be within \"an element that accepts phrasing content\".",
